        "subheading": "<p>For more than a century, Bolsius has been a leader in perfecting and producing superior candles. Kisco is proud to carry these high-quality Bolsius Candles that burn better, brighter and longer. These smokeless and dripless candles are as beautiful as they are friendly to the environment. It's no wonder that Bolsius candles are our all-time best-sellers. </p>",
        "link": "https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bolsius-candles",
        "link_text": "Explore Bolsius",
        "button_style": "btn--primary",
